@startuml
title Top up a wallet | FR-008/010 | BR-027–032 | Simulated payment
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor "Wallet owner" as U
participant SkillSwap as S
participant "Simulated payment provider" as P
participant Wallet as W
U -> S: Choose an amount in VND to add to the wallet
S -> P: Prepare a demonstration checkout
P --> S: Payment reference and demonstration checkout link
S -> S: Save the top-up request
S --> U: Demonstration checkout details
P -> S: Report the simulated payment outcome
S -> S: Check payment authenticity and find the top-up request
alt Unknown payment or already processed outcome
 S --> P: Acknowledge without changing the wallet again
else Payment completed
 S -> W: Add credits once and record the wallet history
 S -> S: Update the top-up status
 S --> P: Top-up applied
else Payment reversed
 S -> W: Record an offsetting wallet deduction once
 S -> S: Update the top-up status
 S --> P: Reversal applied
end
note over S,W: 1 credit = 1,000 VND.\nWallet changes and top-up status are saved separately in current code.
note over U,P: Demonstration provider only, no real-money checkout is integrated.
@enduml
